# `pnpm tree` output, and the push airdrop's ledger. Real roots and proofs are
# published, not committed — `fixtures/` is the committed one, and it is only
# test data. Keep a copy of a mainnet airdrop ledger somewhere that is not here:
# it is the record of who was paid, and a re-run needs it to know that.
out

